WEBVTT

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:17.230
The place where we made our first step...

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:20.190
It's a place we should commemorate, right?

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.810
Thanks for coming with me.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:25.940
Of course. I slept early last night,
so I'm totally fine.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:29.560
Mei was the one who didn't wake up--
even though I tried to wake her.

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:33.100
But you'd never leave me behind, right?

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.980
Wh-Who knows? I wonder...

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:38.400
You're so stubborn, Suzu- <i>nyan</i> !

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.900
Stop it, Mei!

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.100
Suzu- <i>nyan</i> , you're so warm!

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.100
I said stop, Mei!

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:46.020
Big Sister took her first step here, too.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:47.400
And today,

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:52.350
we're going to stand on the finals stage she
was supposed to stand on three years ago.

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:54.150
We really made it.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.810
Yeah.

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:57.600
Look! It's sunrise!

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.940
How beautiful!

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:02.230
Let's make it the best performance.

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:04.270
Yeah.

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:07.940
Let's go back before we catch a cold.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.900
Kotono.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.600
Happy birthday.

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:18.940
Thanks.

00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:22.770
Hey!

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:26.730
Sakura...

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:30.440
It's so pretty.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:32.520
It's so refreshing.

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:36.100
It's going to be an unforgettable day.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.350
The finals stage.

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:40.730
Let's fight with our all.

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:41.900
Yup.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.850
The weather's fine today.

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:51.230
Are you there, Mana?

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:53.730
You are, right?

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:59.810
You promised you wouldn't disappear
until you saw the finals performance.

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:03.650
Oh...?

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:05.230
Not here?

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:06.440
What is it?

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:07.770
Where's Mr. Makino?

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:09.600
He was here at the end of rehearsal...

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:11.980
Could he be in the other dressing room?

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:13.310
He wasn't there.

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:15.770
Where could he be?

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:17.600
I don't see Mana anywhere.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:20.690
Yeah, she's been gone since this morning.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:21.600
What?

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.270
Could it be she's already...?

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:26.310
No, I don't think she disappeared yet.

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:30.100
She said she'd watch
everyone's finals performance.

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.270
She was always good at keeping her word
for important things like that.

00:02:33.270 --> 00:02:35.850
But she did seem really distressed.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:39.150
Maybe she's trying to conserve
her energy as much as possible.

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:40.900
Maybe.

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:43.190
There you are, Mr. Makino!

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:44.060
What's up?

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:47.900
Actually, I wanted to tell Miss Mana something.

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:49.440
Is she here right now?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.520
What?

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.350
Yeah...

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.650
Yeah, she's here...

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:55.190
Where?

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:09.150
Miss Mana, I'll be singing, putting in my all.

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:13.310
And I'll fight against Kotono and
the others with all my might.

00:03:13.310 --> 00:03:15.230
So please watch me.

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:22.440
Big Sister...

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:26.350
I want you to watch me...

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:30.900
The finals performance of
Moon Tempest's Kotono Nagase.

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:37.900
The Next Venus Grand Prix finals battle

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:41.440
between Sunny Peace and Moon Tempest
will begin momentarily.

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:44.690
All our seniors are here!

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:46.100
Y-Yeah...

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.350
Hey, hey.

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:49.600
If you don't greet them properly,

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.850
you'll get beat up by
the scary person from LizNoir.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:54.190
Wh-What?!

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:56.900
W-We better hurry, then!

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:01.310
The finals three years ago...

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:03.770
It was Mana Nagase vs. LizNoir.

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:08.690
To be honest, I couldn't imagine
LizNoir winning.

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:11.850
Mana at the time was unbeatable.

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:14.730
That finals turned out to be a mirage.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:18.400
Fans are still after that mirage today.

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.690
Along with you and me.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:22.730
You're right.

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:26.310
But watching the semi-finals
changed my thinking.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:31.350
Between the current LizNoir and TRINITYAiLE,
I can't say who'd win.

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:34.060
Next year's even more of a toss-up.

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.350
Same goes with us, too.

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.270
I gave you the game this time--

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.060
It was a narrow margin.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:42.400
Next time, I'll win.

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.400
♬ This feeling in our hearts ♬

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:49.230
♬ Together ♬

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.230
♬ Let's shine ♬

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:52.730
♬ Brightly! ♬

00:05:07.150 --> 00:05:09.150
Amazing...

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:12.400
That vortex of light looks like stars!

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:16.100
Feelings are flowing into me
from all around this place.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:22.020
My heart is beating so fast.
Way faster than ever before!

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.100
There's more to this sensation
than just pleasure.

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:27.350
It's scary and it feels like
it's about to burst.

00:05:27.350 --> 00:05:30.440
But it continues to beat my heart passionately!

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:33.020
It's my very own beating heart!

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:37.900
♬ The beating of my heart lets me know ♬

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:42.230
♬ These feelings in my heart ♬

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.310
♬ If I can face them ♬

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:45.350
♬ I can ♬

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.900
♬ Establish myself ♬

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:47.780
♬ Become ♬

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:48.230
♬ Even ♬

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:51.690
♬ Stronger! ♬

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:55.480
--♬ This feeling in our hearts ♬
--♬ Together ♬

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:58.730
--♬ Let's shine ♬
--♬ Brightly! ♬

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:02.520
♬ I want to illuminate you brightly! ♬

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.230
♬ Sunny P! ♬

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:06.170
♬ Hold me tight right now ♬

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:06.900
♬ What should I do? ♬

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:08.180
♬ The beating doesn't stop ♬

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:09.970
♬ I miss you ♬

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:11.310
Are you watching, Mana?

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:18.190
♬ Become a star ♬

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:23.100
♬ I want to shine all the time ♬

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:33.240
Gekka Hakanabi

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:55.060
Big Sister, are you watching?

00:06:55.060 --> 00:07:00.060
Three years ago, you said you wanted me
to watch your finals performance.

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:04.690
I really understand how you felt now.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:08.190
And yet, that time, I...

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:17.150
But... I can say this now.

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:20.310
I'm glad you were there, Big Sister.

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:23.150
♬ In the true darkness ♬

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:26.770
♬ I couldn't see anything ♬

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:31.150
♬ But I found out what it means "to shine" ♬

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.900
♬ The moonlight shines on your light ♬

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:35.900
I'm glad you were an idol, Big Sister!

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.850
♬ It's so bright and brings happiness ♬

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.850
♬ Everything starts to change ♬

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:45.020
♬ The waxing and waning shakes
the darkness in my heart ♬

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.730
♬ I'll accept it and won't hesitate anymore ♬

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:51.850
♬ I'll do as much as I want to in this moment ♬

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:57.230
♬ It's so uncertain I could crumble
at any moment ♬

00:07:57.230 --> 00:07:59.690
♬ But you illuminate me ♬

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:02.310
♬ So I'm able to shine ♬

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:25.730
I was watching you, Kotono.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.060
It was the best finals.

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:29.770
Thank you.

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:31.310
Big Sister...

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.310
Big Sister...

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:40.150
This is the finals!

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:43.600
The audience is fired up to the max!

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:50.270
Making their debut on the same day
from Hoshimi Productions,

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:52.650
it's newcomers Sunny Peace
and Moon Tempest!

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:55.020
The two lowest-ranked groups
of the preliminaries

00:08:55.020 --> 00:08:56.690
unexpectedly face off in the finals!

00:08:56.690 --> 00:08:59.230
They're the dark horses
of this year's Grand Prix!

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:03.730
And now, the winner gets determined here!

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:06.100
Next Venus Grand Prix!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:09.810
Who is the winner?!

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:19.810
This is the final count!

00:09:21.230 --> 00:09:26.400
And the winner is...

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:31.270
A draw?!

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:35.100
Nobody was expecting this!

00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:36.270
A...

00:09:36.270 --> 00:09:37.730
...draw...

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:44.350
This is an unexpected development.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:47.100
According to Grand Prix regulations...

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.150
The results just came in.

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:54.190
A draw that occurs with
astronomical probability.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:57.980
When that happens in the finals...!

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:02.810
Both groups are tie-score winners!

00:10:04.020 --> 00:10:06.060
We won...

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:08.900
All of us together...

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:11.270
Kotono! We did it!

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:14.350
I thought it was a wonderful performance!

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:16.100
Thanks, Suzu- <i>nyan</i> !

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:19.060
Thanks to you, we all had fun singing.

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:24.020
Y-You can't say such a thing right now!

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:26.230
I had a lot of fun.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:29.480
Yeah, I don't want it to end yet.

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:33.770
Come on, we need to greet our audience.
Right, Miss Haruko?

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.230
I know, right?

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:39.150
Were you watching, Mana?

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:41.850
The finals stage where you wanted to stand...

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:44.770
They all performed admirably.

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:47.520
What did you think? Amazing, right?

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:50.100
Kotono and Sakura...

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:53.350
At last, they each performed with
their own self-discovered voice.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:56.650
That was the performance you wanted, right?

00:10:56.650 --> 00:10:57.850
Yup.

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:00.190
Mana?

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:02.850
Now there's nothing to worry about.

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:04.600
Mana?

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.020
Thank you.

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:10.770
Mana...

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:22.350
Everyone, that was an outstanding performance.

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:23.730
Congratulations.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.230
You all did well.

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:27.440
Thank you very much!

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:31.600
The winner's performance
is happening after this.

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:33.310
Since you're tie-score winners,

00:11:33.310 --> 00:11:38.230
both Sunny Peace and
Moon Tempest can perform.

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:39.440
That means...!

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:41.600
We can keep performing then?

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:42.220
Yeah.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:43.690
All right!

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:46.100
Let's standby with the songs
each group prepared--

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:48.650
Actually, Mr. Makino...

00:11:48.650 --> 00:11:51.270
What do you think of this idea?

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.310
Mr. Makino.

00:11:56.310 --> 00:12:00.310
Was Miss Mana happy with what she saw?

00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:01.600
Yeah.

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:04.270
I think I saw her, too.

00:12:04.270 --> 00:12:06.520
My sister in the audience.

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.770
I heard her voice, too.

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:11.020
What was she saying?

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:13.230
She said, "Thank you."

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:16.190
Yeah, she did say that.

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.350
Hey!

00:12:18.350 --> 00:12:21.520
The new setlist was approved.

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:22.980
Got it!

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:22.980
Yes!

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:26.310
All right everyone, get ready!

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.560
Yes!

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:32.480
Mr. Makino...

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:34.400
Where's Mana?

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:39.850
No...

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:43.190
I didn't get to say goodbye yet...

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:45.190
Mei.

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:46.980
You still need to perform.

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:50.060
Go do it for Mana.

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:55.440
Yeah... You're right!

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:57.020
I will!

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:05.060
They went beyond my expectations.

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:06.310
Yes.

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:08.690
And... you, too.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.060
Thank you very much.

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:15.150
A lot happened,

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:17.850
but I think you're finally full-fledged now.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.020
Um, Mr. Saegusa.

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:24.980
I've got a favor to ask.

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:56.270
Mana... You always disappear unexpectedly.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:59.190
You don't let me say anything.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:05.560
♬ I'm still in the middle ♬

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:12.690
♬ of a faraway dream ♬

00:14:12.690 --> 00:14:19.730
♬ To the utmost go on ♬

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:29.810
♬ As the precious things ♬

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:36.730
♬ stay the same ♬

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:37.560
♬ From the beginning ♬

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:40.400
Wow! A shooting star!

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:47.190
♬ I want to bring my voice to you ♬

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:54.230
♬ Right now ♬

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:55.730
♬ Song for you ♬

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:58.730
Actually...

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:01.520
Will you be my manager?

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:04.270
Manager? Isn't this a bit...

00:15:04.270 --> 00:15:06.940
I won't make you regret it.

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:10.020
I won't make you regret it, no matter what.

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:12.850
There could be a ton of challenges.

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:18.190
But someday you'll feel like saying,
"I'm glad I became a manager

00:15:18.190 --> 00:15:21.190
and said yes that time," I promise!

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.230
Even if it costs me my life.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:28.900
When she makes that face,
she carries out her words no matter what.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:33.350
Even if it costs her life, huh?

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:36.730
She didn't need to go that far.

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:42.480
Hey! Makino!

00:15:42.480 --> 00:15:44.850
You can't sneak out in the middle!

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:47.060
It's an important performance.

00:15:47.060 --> 00:15:51.600
Give me a break at least at the end.

00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:54.350
It's time, right?

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:59.060
I'm surprised you knew I was here.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:00.400
It's the second time.

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:03.190
Still, you can be pretty dull, Makino.

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:06.020
I'm... aware of that.

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:10.400
You don't change at all, Makino.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:12.100
You, too.

00:16:15.310 --> 00:16:19.980
So you don't regret accepting
my invitation that time, right?

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:21.690
That's right.

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:26.520
But I really wanted to be a top idol.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:30.350
Then, I would've been able
to fulfill my real dream.

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:32.150
Your real dream?

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:33.980
Yup.

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:38.650
I wanted to make you the manager
of a top idol, Makino.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:46.480
That's... your... real dream?

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:47.810
That's right.

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:54.440
And my only regret is how I
never got to tell you in person.

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:57.440
No way...

00:16:57.440 --> 00:17:00.190
But I'm fine now!

00:17:00.190 --> 00:17:04.770
There are others who'll
fulfill this dream for me.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:07.810
Right, Makino?

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:09.940
Why...

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:11.900
Why did you choose me?

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.440
Why...?

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:15.940
Let's see...

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:20.350
Well, you're pure, hard-working, serious...

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:24.150
I mean, there were lots of things
that bothered me, too.

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:28.020
But I'm glad...

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:31.270
...that I fell in love with you, Makino.

00:17:33.270 --> 00:17:37.310
I'm... the manager...

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:39.650
That's why...

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:43.400
That's why... I always...

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:47.100
If only I could kiss you.

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:50.650
♬ Song for you ♬

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:52.730
