00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:00.770
♬ Always watching ♬

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:06.810
♬ Always watching me ♬

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:15.480
♬ To the precious days I spent with you ♬

00:18:15.480 --> 00:18:18.730
♬ I want to send a "thank you" ♬

00:18:18.730 --> 00:18:20.650
♬ The courage ♬

00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:26.690
♬ The courage you gave me ♬

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:34.810
♬ I'll hold it in my arms and
hope for tomorrow ♬

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:43.440
♬ I'll become the brightest light ♬

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:48.600
