00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:48.980
Me too. It all seems so surreal.

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:51.770
This isn't a dream, it's reality.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:53.520
The only thing left to do

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:57.310
is to deliver the best performance we can.

00:19:57.310 --> 00:20:01.100
Hey, hey. Do you think we can
reach the top as idols?

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:02.480
We will!

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:06.230
My heart's beating fast and telling me we will!

00:20:06.230 --> 00:20:10.150
This is the starting line of our next goal.

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:25.650
♬ Hey! What makes it a coincidence? ♬

00:20:25.650 --> 00:20:28.020
♬ What makes it meant to be? ♬

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:32.690
♬ When I'm with you I don't know ♬

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:36.270
♬ Ah The strong impression like a dream ♬

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:38.810
♬ And the impulse I felt the day we met ♬

00:20:38.810 --> 00:20:43.480
♬ We drew each other in without
a second thought ♬

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:46.190
♬ Without realizing ♬

00:20:46.190 --> 00:20:48.900
♬ The works of fate ♬

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:51.310
♬ We were always there for each other ♬

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:54.650
♬ Isn't it funny? ♬

00:20:54.650 --> 00:21:00.020
♬ In the center of our miraculous meeting ♬

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:05.190
♬ It's okay for me to cry a little, right? ♬

00:21:05.190 --> 00:21:10.810
♬ The story that begins with goodbye ♬

00:21:10.810 --> 00:21:14.150
♬ The heartrending feeling stabbed ♬

00:21:14.150 --> 00:21:17.900
♬ Deep into my heart is painful ♬

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:19.270
♬ But when I start to run ♬

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:22.650
♬ I create the starting line there ♬

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:25.350
♬ With you ♬

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:27.900
♬ I want to keep running ♬

00:21:27.900 --> 00:21:30.600
♬ Destiny ♬

